## Fixing Dropdown Menu in Mobile Nav

**Date**: November 26, 2024

### Description
I encountered an issue where the dropdown menu in the mobile navbar wasn't toggling when moved to an external JS file.

### Solution
1. Used `DOMContentLoaded` to ensure the DOM was fully loaded before running the script.
2. Added `defer` to the `<script>` tag in the HTML to delay script execution until the document parsing was complete.

### Lessons Learned
- Ensure scripts are executed only after DOM elements are available.
- Debug using browser dev tools to check for errors or missing files.
